[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994356762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107473#issuecomment-2994356762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107473","id":2994356762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yekIa","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T18:12:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T18:14:01Z","body":"OK on Samsung Tab S7 with Mobile Renderer. (Android 13)\r\n\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.4ca772276 (2025-06-19 02:10:56 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.1.128 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: Qualcomm - Adreno (TM) 650\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot on Pixel 8a, Mali GPU. (Android 16)\r\nI think it's like in the video from @syntaxerror247  _(Tested as Android export, not via editor)_\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\nOpenGLES/Compatibility is faulty on both devices, making it seem as if the app is frozen. \r\n\r\nChanging `surfaceView.setVisibility` only partially works; on the Samsung Tab S7, the app is completely transparent at first, which seems like a crash. But touching the screen shows the UI again, without any 3D content.\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994356762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994365579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107473#issuecomment-2994365579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107473","id":2994365579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yemSL","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T18:32:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T18:32:11Z","body":"Note: In the demo, `application/run/low_processor_mode` is enabled. If I disable it, the \"visibility hack\" works better.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994365579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046300348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107473#issuecomment-3046300348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107473","id":3046300348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61ktq8","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T19:29:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T20:11:57Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 @Alex2782 After some explorations, it doesn't look like we can (yet) support switching transparency at runtime.\r\n\r\nThe update to the pixel format causes the surface to be destroyed and recreated. On opengl on Android, we don't support that at all, and typically restart the app when such event occurs (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d1f26e1fd1fa46f2223fe0b6ac300744bf79b88/platform/android/java_godot_lib_jni.cpp#L239), which negates the point of being able to switch the transparency at runtime.\r\nWith vulkan, things are a bit better and we can continue without having to restart the app, but doing so still seems to create some issues as a bunch of warnings appear in the logs following the surface recreation.\r\n\r\nTLDR; handling surface recreation is an area we'll need to improve on before we're able to enable switching transparency on/off at runtime. cc @clayjohn \r\nAs such, in the meantime transparency can only be set at start-time and is controlled by the `display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed` project setting. The `display/window/size/transparent` setting and the `WINDOW_FLAG_TRANSPARENT` flag have no effect on Android.\r\n\r\nIf `display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed` is enabled, the project can still control its transparency via `get_viewport().transparent_bg`. \r\nNote however there seems to be a bug on how this is handled between `vulkan` and `opengl`. It works as expected on `opengl`, but on `vulkan`, the background seems to inherit some transparency even when `get_viewport().transparent_bg == false`. I'll create a bug for the rendering team for the latter issue.\r\n\r\nEdit: I've created https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108386 to track the described issue with the vulkan renderer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046300348/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046510459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107473#issuecomment-3046510459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107473","id":3046510459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61lg97","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T21:01:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T21:01:18Z","body":"> TLDR; handling surface recreation is an area we'll need to improve on before we're able to enable switching transparency on/off at runtime.\r\n\r\nSee also https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6423.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046510459/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075439754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107473#issuecomment-3075439754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107473","id":3075439754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63T3yK","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T20:25:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T20:27:41Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 @Alex2782 Ping on this PR.\r\n\r\nNote that I think I may have an approach to enable switching the transparency at runtime, but this builds on top of [an upcoming large set of changes](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105529), so that capability would be 4.6 at the earliest.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, we should move ahead with the current capability and limitations for 4.5.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075439754/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3079389780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107473#issuecomment-3079389780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107473","id":3079389780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63i8JU","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/